{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "line-3",
      "text": "希望找到人生最水的美夢",
      "spelling": "hi-bāng tshuē tio̍h lîn-sing siōng suí ê bí-bāng",
      "source_lines": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-6",
      "text": "頭前就是美麗的所在",
      "spelling": "thâu-tsîng tio̍h sī bí-lē sóo-tsāi",
      "source_lines": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-9",
      "text": "一個美麗的所在",
      "spelling": "tsi̍t ê bí-lē sóo-tsāi",
      "source_lines": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-12",
      "text": "沒鹹沒汫 真正沒啥滋味",
      "spelling": "bô kiâm bô tsiánn  tsin-tsiànn bô-siánn tsu-bī",
      "source_lines": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-15",
      "text": "我的生活無聊 真正會氣死",
      "spelling": "guá ê sing-ua̍h bô-liâu  tsin-tsiànn ē khì-sí",
      "source_lines": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-18",
      "text": "要有新的想法 代誌才會趣味",
      "spelling": "ài ū sin ê siūnn-huat  tāi-tsì tsiah ē tshù-bī",
      "source_lines": [
        18,
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-21",
      "text": "創造一個有希望的未來",
      "spelling": "tshòng-tsō tsi̍t ê ū hi-bāng ê bī-lâi",
      "source_lines": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-24",
      "text": "啊 阮做阮的眠夢",
      "spelling": "ah  gún tsuè gún ê bîn-bāng",
      "source_lines": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-27",
      "text": "笑我頭空空",
      "spelling": "tshiò guá thâu khàng khàng",
      "source_lines": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-30",
      "text": "口袋沒半項",
      "spelling": "lak-tē-á bô puànn hāng",
      "source_lines": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-33",
      "text": "啊 你找你的願望",
      "spelling": "ah  lí tshuē lí ê guān-bāng",
      "source_lines": [
        33,
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-36",
      "text": "總有那一天",
      "spelling": "tsóng ē ū tsi̍t kang",
      "source_lines": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-39",
      "text": "頭前是美麗的所在",
      "spelling": "thâu-tsîng sī bí-lē ê sóo-tsāi",
      "source_lines": [
        39,
